Z||000002||JohnF||12-24-2001||05:00 PM||||I am just getting started but,<BR>3.1 pre-owned w/6 mo. warranty (pulled from GM wreck w/less than 60K) professionally installed $1400.00 complete (remove old engine, install used). $700 engine, $700 labor.<P>2.8 (now 2.9) rebuilt by Ed Parks @ Fiero Factory and delivered to your door $1350. You install.<P>2.8 pulled and rebuilt by you (no labor costs) prices start at about $400 for a thorough job and go up to $800+.<P>Standard rate for engines exchange (remove old - install new)$600 to $800.<P>ARI w/stroker kit about the same as Ed Parks.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://photos.msn.com/ImageServer/Image.aspx?Image=0h9xCkj4Yyo6VbTdcNrmhglJSkAWB6C91volMeDlp0h*oii8TPGa20kyOxpdcqzP8qgFSFmsURSXXLzrLUqyll5ofimdP92*FNFuzBBDM1PEajQxQ*Q8WWq*rfvz6!x4pUtE2EsH24ClDyP3oWXL*H41TkaSbtSsDJGlSZ4dol6UKjqoNXe9R!uqr1PsTEkyvCkblQOE!Ntm6y7ZIR0Yh4dj5E3iRUs!aOGI2F9kotBxoa!4otRtSuGucZ1Pen9q24d0hrglVvzK*EY4KHAosZ4!AMC1kyuNFUR*urYcA*t61aKP0zREsXUVoyq0!cXPxGXJFnyglKwpMClTPrmLCQv*qNBY9KpHMNz9*AOylphEbbQcqGuVPQ$$"> <P>You can have all the SPEED you can afford!||||reg||14
