Z||000004||artherd||12-26-2001||04:21 AM||||Crazy cammed up 365hp 8500rpm Northstar (getrag):<P>Self: ~$8,000. plus car.   Pro: $15-20K+? (available at all? only pro turn-keys I know of are autos.  With enough $ anything can happen...)<P>The rest of the stuff you'll want to do to the car to get it ready to really rock: another $5-10k depending on condition of the donor. (upgrading suspension, brakes, wheels, tyres, driveline, interior, etc.)<P>Best!<BR>Ben<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">      <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red.                     "Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver, In-Progreess.                                        -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
